{"articleNo":"100584","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=100584&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014-1 생활관 입사자 입사조건(룸메이트, 식사변경)및 입사포기 환불신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.11","hit":"5714","attachments":[{"name":"식사선택 변경 신청서(재학생 및 신입생).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=100584&attachNo=72225"},{"name":"룸메이트 사전 지정 신청서[1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=100584&attachNo=72349"},{"name":"환불(퇴사)신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=100584&attachNo=73409"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014-1학기 생활관 입사자&nbsp;입사조건(룸메이트, 식사변경)및 입사포기에 따른 환불 신청을</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다음과 같이 안내합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ed0000\"><u>아래 기간 이후에는 신청이 불가하오니, 필히 정해진 기간 내에 신청해 주시기 바랍니다.</u></font></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1.&nbsp;신청기간 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">1)</font>&nbsp;<font color=\"#0900ff\">룸메이트 및 환불 </font>: </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2014. 2. 17(월) 09:00&nbsp;~ 2. 19(수) 18:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2)&nbsp;식사변경(푸름관) : 2014. 2. 24(월) 09:00&nbsp;~ 2. 26(수) 18:00</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 마감 시간(18시) 이후 도착분은 인정 불가</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>* 오름관은 7일 의무식이므로 식사&nbsp;변경 불가</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2.&nbsp;신청방법 : 행정실 방문 또는 이메일 신청</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;1) 방문 접수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 각 관 행정실(푸름관 : 관리동 2층 204호, 오름관 : 102호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2) 이메일 접수</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; : 각 관 담당자에게 메일 발송</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 첨부파일의 양식 작성</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 메일 제목에 신청 내용의 간략한 키워드와 본인의 이름 반드시 명시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예) 2014-1학기 식사변경 (유관순)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 메일 발송</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; *룸메이트 사전지정 : <a href=\"mailto:shinks@kumoh.ac.kr(%ED%91%B8%EB%A6%84%EA%B4%80\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">shinks@kumoh.ac.kr</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(푸름관</span></a>), <a href=\"mailto:cutest@kumoh.ac.kr(%EC%98%A4%EB%A6%84%EA%B4%80\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">cutest@kumoh.ac.kr</font><font color=\"#747474\">(오름관</font></a><font color=\"#747474\">)</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청대상 : 대학원생 및 외국인, 형제자매</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; *식사변경 및 환불 : <u><font color=\"#0900ff\">ogiogi80</font></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"mailto:ogiogi80@kumoh.ac.kr(%ED%91%B8%EB%A6%84%EA%B4%80\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">@kumoh.ac.kr</font>(푸름관</a>), <a href=\"mailto:cutest@kumoh.ac.kr(%EC%98%A4%EB%A6%84%EA%B4%80\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">cutest@kumoh.ac.kr</font></a><a href=\"mailto:cutest@kumoh.ac.kr(%EC%98%A4%EB%A6%84%EA%B4%80\"><font color=\"#747474\">(오름관</font></a><font color=\"#747474\">)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청대상 : 2014-1학기 생활관비 납부자</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HSt